  m_text: "Some faces of a model can be copied into a separate object. Give only that object an emissive material, and only those faces glow.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> You copy the front faces of the frame into a new object and make it emissive. Does the floor in front of the frame get brighter?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. In Face mode, select the front faces.\n2. Use Duplicate Faces, with its option set to GameObject (a new object).\n3. Give the new object M_Kit_Neon-Cyan (the asset library's Materials/Kit folder).\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Liminal-Kit 4 \xB7 Light shapes</color></size>"
