  m_text: "An opening is made by removing faces. The faces are already split into a grid (as in station 1), so the middle column can be selected on its own.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> You delete the middle faces on the front and on the back. Look into the gap from an angle: what will you see inside?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Select the three middle faces of the middle column, front and back (Face mode).\n2. Delete them.\n3. Close each side of the gap with Bridge Edges.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Liminal-Kit 1 \xB7 Walls and openings (Slit wall)</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
